uán khác. Bún ăn khá ngon, mình chấm 7/10 theo khẩu vị cũa mình. Quán của người huế thiệt, mấy bạn trỏng nói tiếng huế nghe khá ngọt và thanh 😸","Images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMC1q2yaHvnxsfCCn2zbWUZEIHv1B2qalhPRCz9UnxMF-mHa6fSwAw6zOq3YPMhazOxevhYGH8Jrx1WaJHsYiIn9KsXgN2CrB61lsgU7eNnvf7TIfNJwN8CXruvirvZM4jw9B_F=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMDo0FZNiVvkxAy0ynDn0DLo8dX1M2R7jUHDRmK36JcFpRHHQ1SzG-4L6sHQg-ByqjzAGAw1Q827RIfsJha_vvLOtDuFNPUyd15HVsj46wbCgTRkTjOaoymVpxcFET4Ngg2DRv0=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNaI5X5UvBSTXMAjoIIODJm7VdG1Tpgpfp1e6LH3tgqCzSOTOkBgsXzVEwHoEU5upwWbCqZUjc6ZsJl0hgwlcgZulcO2OPGavgDYRM5rAyR5CmoC23oo1YS5pmow99TqwTq8sE=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmOSQRJ-s9suKRI0EG2TLNE6uijb5aL-tVfWPS1OhJEBReyWmbSkTNoZvogkUA6JGyZ_DlW_0guMaGDo1SoGyjK5UmX2cvpNBbtFHirHUx4D2PFFBRUGeJrG7WpLhPQRjFbnh4pR=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmM-KJVZkQb5IQbIgpM9B4yHrEdMId1_FlnDR24sqiZRv3PgFI5hxog-xng_nRUGgB3sLwI-BIvcNT4TQW7PgbGxmWckh-iKTscdvHHoU5h43GvAmw3hZnFI5VfeDWEuu-RUVx3q=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNW2p5owZ-C9HBqDeah0E8VB3nk8O8XbzPgR4odaQihlhUQHLW7GxpmmqEDq_5sDz3y_oia-fIY1uuLX4PvVpjEHWCgf5bKoOWOjw5UiYaI4YdqGjroVEs5f2nSvkUR2d8jraix=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmN1N3wJ3LHiGFyV1dcg_TjV82p6LTiUCPIMne-iFdoOes_g5pZvaUvW2yscwxLLOYmh0RJjmbRCHN9P-YXA2_lY3VX6cTYTIqB2krfnYOFxGWumVu4cGkw2LXCSY24xD-XmFTU_=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmOc8q-TKeWaLJhRvAxN0MWQf7DACo5PM28HnVllrbKdJCM-nQEEE7oCRYexO4_NHVqC5sxWQQSGjY-ts9nIA0uvV-nO1emgV7axTDKoPoy6jd6-bZplhJajEf6OB2w5F9EUofM7=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmM3QiGat2ejrYMUniHELz0YrI1W6ftan9k20srbNA2FWMlGqB7rkqtLk-fCuIyT34HEYunhGKSzpLSDKLrfti15Q9ygnZlJNCiTSg4UN4bUj1uDA4NKIP0Ev22bXFCMt26KFaLlUg=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPF9MkuYzAk1YkFAMojyJBX--ahTrt9qXtE0c3XKtMrA_R-xFqPR1eUnq2gBQpXiSasj8gtShyfE